# {{.project_name}}

Native GPUI desktop app.

## Stack

- GPUI Kit 0.10.0, pinned GPUI snapshot 0.3.12
- Rust 1.96
- SQLite, keyring, tracing, Tokio bridge
- cargo-packager

## Prerequisites

Linux requires the GPUI native development packages. See
[`docs/BUILD.md`](docs/BUILD.md). If linking fails with
`unable to find library -lxkbcommon`, install
`libxkbcommon-dev libxkbcommon-x11-dev`.

