## Commands

```bash
make doctor
make install
make run
make check
make test
make lint
make fmt
make package
```

`make run` installs a local desktop entry on Linux so the Smoke icon appears in the desktop shell. Packaged builds use the bundled icon.

Read `CONTEXT.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `DESIGN.md`, and `docs/UI.md` before changing code.

